WorkflowRouter_onReport
  ├── when the contract is paused
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the caller does not have the KEYSTONE_FORWARDER_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the workflow ID is zero
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the workflow name is zero
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the workflow owner is zero
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the workflow metadata does not match
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the report is too short
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the selector is not allowlisted
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when all conditions are met
      └── it should succeed
